Baijie Helper A133 board is a development board around Baijie A133 Core
SBC. Features:

- 1/2/4GiB LPDDR4 DRAM
- 8/16/32GiB eMMC
- AXP707 PMIC
- 2 USB 2.0 ports
- MicroSD slot and on-board eMMC module
- Gigabit Ethernet
- Bluetooth
